{"ticker":"MOS","updated":"2026-10-30T22:59:18Z","profile":{"longName":"The Mosaic Company","shortName":"Mosaic Company (The)","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Agricultural Inputs","country":"United States","website":"https://www.mosaicco.com","fullTimeEmployees":13000,"marketCap":5846100992,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":12.447543,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.47731456,"pegRatio":2.02,"targetMeanPrice":25.88333,"targetHighPrice":35.0,"targetLowPrice":17.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":18,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":-0.06,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.11236,"operatingMargins":-0.00117,"profitMargins":-0.05213,"totalRevenue":12247900160,"beta":0.918,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":32.25,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":16.99,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":4.83},"summary":"The Mosaic Company, through its subsidiaries, produces and markets concentrated phosphate and potash crop nutrients. It operates in three segments: Phosphates, Potash, and Mosaic Fertilizantes. The company owns and operates mines and production facilities, which produce concentrated phosphate crop nutrients and phosphate-based animal feed ingredients, as well as concentrated phosphate crop nutrients, such as diammonium phosphate, monoammonium phosphate, and MicroEssentials, a value-added ammoniated phosphate product. It also mines, processes, and sells potash to crop nutrient manufacturers, distributors, retailers, and to customers for industrial use; and owns and operates mines, chemical plants, crop nutrient blending and bagging facilities, port terminals and warehouses, which produce and sell concentrated phosphate and potash-based crop nutrients, and phosphate-based animal feed ingredients. In addition, the company produces a double sulfate of potash magnesia product under the K-Mag brand; and purchases phosphate, potash, and nitrogen products to produce blended crop nutrients. Further, it offers triple superphosphate, single superphosphate, and dicalcium phosphate; feed phosphate under the Biofos and Nexfos brands; potash for de-icing and as a water softener regenerant; and phosphogypsum. The company sells its products to wholesale distributors, retail chains, cooperatives","summary_zh":"馬賽克公司透過其子公司生產和銷售濃縮磷酸鹽和鉀肥作物營養素。它的業務分為三個部分：磷酸鹽、鉀鹽和馬賽克肥料。該公司擁有並經營礦山和生產設施，生產濃縮磷酸鹽作物營養素和磷酸鹽動物飼料成分，以及濃縮磷酸鹽作物營養素，如磷酸二銨、磷酸一銨和加值氨化磷酸鹽產品MicroEssentials。它還開採、加工鉀肥，並將其銷售給作物養分製造商、分銷商、零售商以及工業用途的客戶；擁有並經營礦山、化工廠、作物養分混合和裝袋設施、港口碼頭和倉庫，生產和銷售濃縮磷酸鹽和鉀基作物養分以及磷酸鹽動物飼料成分。此外，該公司還生產K-Mag品牌的雙硫酸鉀鎂產品；並購買磷酸鹽、鉀肥和氮產品來生產混合作物營養素。此外，還提供重過磷酸鈣、單過磷酸鈣和磷酸二鈣； Biofos 和 Nexfos 品牌的飼料磷酸鹽；用於除冰和作為軟水劑再生劑的鉀肥；和磷石膏。該公司將產品銷售給批發經銷商、零售連鎖店、合作社","sector_zh":"基礎材料","industry_zh":"農業投入","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":33.16,"h":33.4,"l":32.97,"c":33.25,"v":3177500},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":32.97,"h":33.03,"l":32.61,"c":32.69,"v":3390600},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":32.42,"h":32.65,"l":32.13,"c":32.62,"v":4285500},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":32.88,"h":33.06,"l":32.21,"c":32.45,"v":4273300},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":32.44,"h":33.02,"l":32.35,"c":32.58,"v":4959900},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":32.71,"h":32.74,"l":32.09,"c":32.16,"v":3232500},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":32.21,"h":33.55,"l":32.17,"c":33.41,"v":4756700},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":33.34,"h":33.81,"l":33.26,"c":33.68,"v":5408500},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":33.6,"h":33.8,"l":33.49,"c":33.65,"v":3338800},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":33.72,"h":34.59,"l":33.55,"c":34.05,"v":4556400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":34.01,"h":34.24,"l":33.45,"c":33.82,"v":3834500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":34.05,"h":34.51,"l":33.82,"c":34.16,"v":3969800},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":34.02,"h":34.36,"l":33.43,"c":34.22,"v":3572900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":34.15,"h":34.32,"l":33.86,"c":33.98,"v":4302200},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":33.86,"h":33.88,"l":33.25,"c":33.43,"v":3230500},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":33.67,"h":34.12,"l":33.42,"c":33.97,"v":2864300},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":34.17,"h":36.03,"l":34.05,"c":35.93,"v":5158300},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":36.14,"h":36.99,"l":34.2,"c":34.79,"v":9841100},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":34.79,"h":35.52,"l":34.31,